	(text "EN: RC 10k/1u delays start-up until 3.3 V is stable.\nHold BOOT while plugging in / pressing RESET -> download mode (normally not needed,\nUSB-Serial/JTAG flashes directly). Status LED on GPIO13 = LED1 of the firmware.\nGPIO17 -> RS-485 D (TX), GPIO18 <- RS-485 R (RX): firmware default for ESP32-S3.\nAntenna: module at the board edge, no copper under the antenna (keepout)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 175.26 0)
